title: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Retroactive authorization
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?type=retro (Intake)
intro: A retroactive authorization asks for approval of care that was already given. Intake starts from the care: the patient (known, or entered by hand), the payer, the service, the dates of service, why no authorization was in place, and the supporting documents. It says up front that retro approval depends on the payer and may not be available, and shows the payer's own Backdating rule when one is saved.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: every built-in payer has a Backdating rule. A payer added on Payers has none, which shows the 'No rule on file' wording.
---
start s1 "Pick 'Retroactive authorization' in 'Authorization type'\nOr open ?type=retro"
screen sc "Intake · Retroactive authorization\n'Care was delivered before an authorization was in place. Say what, when and why.'\nCard 'Retroactive authorization'"
decision dRule "Is a payer chosen, and has it a Backdating rule on file?"
toast tPick "'Retroactive authorization depends on the payer and may not be available. Pick the payer to see its Backdating rule.'"
toast tRule "'Retroactive authorization depends on the payer and may not be available. Summit's Backdating rule: ...'"
toast tNo "'... No rule on file for Riverbend Health. Check with the payer.'\nReview & submit adds a note 'Retroactive rule'"
goto gPayers "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Edit a rule"
decision dStart "Has the patient been chosen?"
overlay oPat "Section 'Find a patient who is already known', open\nSearch box, the sites in view only"
goto gFind "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Find a patient and the authorization"
click cHand "Click 'Enter the patient by hand'"
process pHand "The case is marked started\nThe details show"
screen sSite "Site, then the rows\nPatient initials and age · Payer and plan · Member ID · Level of care\nNo 'Request type' row: it is 'Retro-authorization'"
screen sDup "'This looks like a request that already exists' only when one matches"
goto gDup "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Possible duplicate"
screen sDos "Card 'Dates of service'\n'The first and the last day care was given without an authorization. Verify checks coverage for these dates.'"
input iFrom "'First date of service' (required)"
input iTo "'Last date of service'\nWithout it Review & submit asks the person to acknowledge it; the first date is what blocks"
decision dBad "Is the last date before the first?"
toast tBad "Field error: 'The end is before the start.'"
screen sWhy "Card 'Why it was not obtained ahead of time'\n'The payer will ask. Use one of these or write your own. Only what happened goes in the request.'"
click cChip "Click a reason\n'Coverage was pending when the patient was admitted', 'The patient was admitted after hours or on a weekend, and the notice window passed', 'The payer was not known on the day of admission', 'The notice was sent but the payer has no record of it'"
input iReason "Type or edit the 'Reason'"
decision dReason "Is the reason empty?"
toast tReason "Review & submit lists 'Why it was not obtained ahead of time' to acknowledge\n'The payer will ask why no authorization was in place. Add the reason.'"
screen sDoc "Card 'Supporting documents'\nThe admission order, the eligibility check from the admission date, attendance for the dates of service"
input iDrop "Drop supporting documents here, or click to choose files"
agent aRead "Reader sorts the files into the document list\nShown as chips with the file names"
store st "The request is recorded as 'Retro-authorization'\nDates of service, the reason and the files are kept on the case"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Eligibility & Benefits › Retroactive authorization"
goto gDocs "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"
click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
click cCont "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
goto gSave "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Save as draft and leave"

s1 --> sc --> dRule
dRule -->|No payer yet| tPick
dRule -->|Rule on file| tRule
dRule -->|No rule on file| tNo -.-> gPayers
sc --> dStart
dStart -->|No| oPat
oPat --> gFind
oPat --> cHand --> pHand
gFind -.-> sSite
dStart -->|Yes| sSite
pHand --> sSite
sSite --> sDup -.-> gDup
sSite --> sDos --> iFrom --> iTo --> dBad
dBad -->|Yes| tBad --> iTo
dBad -->|No| sWhy
sWhy --> cChip --> iReason
sWhy --> iReason --> dReason
dReason -->|Yes| tReason --> sDoc
dReason -->|No| sDoc
sDoc --> iDrop --> aRead --> st
sDoc --> st
st --> gElig
st --> gDocs
st --> cSave --> gSave
st --> cCont --> gElig
